          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is there a cutoff time for same-day delivery?",
            "content": "<h4>Same-day order cutoffs are at 3:00 PM Monday through Saturday and 2:00 PM on Sunday. Orders placed after the cutoff will be delivered the next day.</h4>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "content_LJPryq": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if I'm not gifting to someone within the delivery radius?",
            "content": "<h4>No worries! You can order online and select shipping at checkout -- we ship nationwide! Our Signature size gift box ships free.</h4>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "content_Bpqw6c": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I schedule a delivery time?",
            "content": "<h4>Yes! You can schedule a delivery time that is convenient to the person you're gifting to at checkout.</h4>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "content_PTCmMy": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How much does same-day delivery cost?",
